## 5. How to Run the Pipeline

Execute any individual stage or run the complete pipeline via CLI:

```powershell
# Run the complete end-to-end pipeline (Ingest -> Preprocess -> Train -> Evaluate -> Infer -> Export)
python run_pipeline.py --all

# Run with custom parameters
python run_pipeline.py --wells 200 --epochs 30 --mc-samples 100

# Run specific modular stages
python run_pipeline.py --stage ingest
python run_pipeline.py --stage preprocess
python run_pipeline.py --stage train
python run_pipeline.py --stage evaluate
python run_pipeline.py --stage infer
python run_pipeline.py --stage export

# Run the test suite
python -m unittest discover -s tests -p "test_*.py"
```
